  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/659/659-71.htm",
  "statuteText": "659:71 When to Prepare Return. –\n\nAfter the tabulation of votes has been completed and the result has been announced by the moderator as provided in RSA 659:70, the town or ward clerk shall prepare the election return in the presence of the other election officials."
}
